\fs22\cf2 D20 Overhaul Mod - Version 1.0 (English)\b0\par\par
\cf3\f1\fs20 Welcome to the KotOR 2 D20 Overhaul installer!\par
\par
MOD OVERVIEW:\par
This mod overhauls KotOR 2's combat, progression, and equipment systems to restore rigorous d20 Star Wars Roleplaying Game (WotC) mathematical balance:\par
\par
1. FEATS & FORCE POWERS:\par
  - 78 new d20 feats (Weapon family specializations, combat styles, attribute feats)\par
    and the 6 Prestige Class powers completely overhauled (including 2 brand-new powers).\par
  - 33 redundant or unbalanced vanilla feats cleanly hidden.\par
  - Rebalanced feat & power progression budgets (22/18/15 feats over 30 levels).\par
\par
2. WEAPONS, ARMOR & SHIELDS:\par
  - Full d20 weapon profile overhaul (damage dice, critical ranges, 1H/2H wielding).\par
  - Light, medium, and heavy armors rebalanced with d20 AC and Max DEX caps.\par
  - Energy shield overhaul and Force power armor restrictions revised.\par
\par
3. WORKBENCH & EQUIPMENT:\par
  - Expanded workbench (and Mira's rocket launcher) with base weapons, level locks,\par
    and 60 armor upgrades (30 underlays + 30 overlays exclusive to Medium Armor).\par
  - Lore-accurate stat caps across helmets, gloves, implants, belts, and armbands.\par
  - Exile's personal crystal customizable via Kreia (automatic or manual choice).\par
\par
4. ENEMY BALANCING:\par
  - 316 creatures & enemies rebalanced + calibrated boss autobalance.\par
\par
COMPATIBILITY:\par
  - Compatible with TSLRCM (The Sith Lords Restored Content Mod) 1.8.6 / 2022.\par
  - Compatible with K2CP (KotOR 2 Community Patch) v1.6.3 (install K2CP first).\par
  - Dynamic merging with automatic backup in 'backup/'.\par
\par
INSTRUCTIONS:\par
Click 'Install Mod' below and select your KotOR 2 ROOT directory (the folder containing swkotor2.exe, NOT the Override subfolder).\par

